WEBVTT

00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:10.010
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:20.895
Oh, sir. What a precious gift.

00:00:21.479 --> 00:00:23.398
-Can it truly be mine?
-Uh-huh.

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.820
Leave him be. He's delighted, eh?

00:00:32.824 --> 00:00:33.950
Dear cousin,

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:37.871
have you ever seen a map drawn
by an Italian named Matteo Ricci?

00:00:38.747 --> 00:00:42.292
I confess, it took me quite a while
to find where Joseon was on it.

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:45.712
Joseon, which had always seemed
so large and definite,

00:00:45.795 --> 00:00:47.422
suddenly felt small.

00:00:48.465 --> 00:00:50.508
In truth, it was a fearful revelation.

00:00:51.676 --> 00:00:53.720
For how small must I be,

00:00:54.512 --> 00:00:56.723
living in my small corner of Hwaseong?

00:01:13.114 --> 00:01:14.282
A letter!

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:16.367
Bring it here!

00:01:16.451 --> 00:01:18.411
A letter for the young lady
in Minister Cho's house!

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:19.496
Here.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:24.042
I have opened a map of Joseon
that was drawn here hundreds of years ago.

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:27.378
By the standards of Western learning,

00:01:27.879 --> 00:01:30.590
Joseon is certainly
the wrong size on this map.

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:35.053
And yet, I have found myself questioning,

00:01:35.553 --> 00:01:37.180
is this map truly wrong?

00:01:37.806 --> 00:01:40.433
Perhaps the mapmaker wished
to capture the hearts of the people

00:01:40.517 --> 00:01:42.477
who stood on this small land.

00:01:43.853 --> 00:01:45.355
As I continue to reflect,

00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:48.566
these two Joseons have prompted me
to realize something further.

00:01:49.317 --> 00:01:52.070
Whether the land beneath us
is small or large,

00:01:52.153 --> 00:01:53.947
we see the world through our eyes,

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:56.074
and they see the world through theirs.

00:01:56.157 --> 00:01:57.450
Such is the way of it.

00:01:58.743 --> 00:02:02.831
Just as I am simply myself,
and you are simply yourself.

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:06.709
What do you think?

00:02:07.544 --> 00:02:09.170
You may call it sophistry,

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:13.800
but I am very curious to hear what
my literary friend makes of such thoughts.

00:02:14.926 --> 00:02:16.302
I await your reply.

00:02:23.184 --> 00:02:26.771
Be straight and steadfast.
And keep the way of the gentleman.

00:02:26.855 --> 00:02:28.064
Do you understand?

00:02:49.043 --> 00:02:50.044
Be straight

00:02:51.421 --> 00:02:52.547
and steadfast.

00:02:53.089 --> 00:02:54.174
Be straight

00:02:54.883 --> 00:02:56.217
and steadfast.

00:02:56.301 --> 00:02:57.302
Steadfast.

00:02:59.679 --> 00:03:01.848
My father passed away so suddenly.

00:03:02.473 --> 00:03:05.185
There is no way
to stop the sorrow rising within me.

00:03:06.895 --> 00:03:08.813
I still need my father here.

00:03:10.607 --> 00:03:13.735
I wanted him to see me become
the kind of son he could be proud of,

00:03:14.402 --> 00:03:15.570
but now it is too late.

00:03:16.571 --> 00:03:17.572
Dear cousin,

00:03:18.531 --> 00:03:19.866
what am I to do?

00:03:21.618 --> 00:03:24.954
I am sorry that I cannot
fully fathom the pain you are in.

00:03:26.122 --> 00:03:27.457
But, Won,

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:30.460
even if I may be the only one
to tell you this,

00:03:30.543 --> 00:03:31.753
you must know

00:03:32.295 --> 00:03:35.256
you are more than just the son
your father wanted you to be.

00:03:35.882 --> 00:03:39.844
You must find yourself,
rather than chasing after someone else.

00:03:40.929 --> 00:03:43.681
I know my words may not reach you
at the moment.

00:03:46.226 --> 00:03:47.685
I am me,

00:03:49.103 --> 00:03:50.480
and you are you.

00:04:02.408 --> 00:04:05.662
Mmm.

00:04:07.288 --> 00:04:08.289
Hmm.

00:04:10.041 --> 00:04:12.168
How wonderfully indecent.

00:04:14.629 --> 00:04:15.630
Hmm.

00:04:18.174 --> 00:04:19.259
Madam.

00:04:20.093 --> 00:04:23.388
Lady Cho, the wife of Minister Yoo,
is here to see you.

00:04:26.307 --> 00:04:27.684
She may enter.

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:33.106
Even in this undyed state,

00:04:33.606 --> 00:04:36.234
it gives off a most lustrous sheen.

00:04:36.317 --> 00:04:39.946
I may go so far as to say
this silk resembles you, my lady.

00:04:40.863 --> 00:04:43.658
The tobacco you sent over
was more than enough.

00:04:44.367 --> 00:04:47.120
You needn't have brought me this as well.

00:04:47.203 --> 00:04:48.746
My most humble thanks.

00:04:51.124 --> 00:04:53.793
I will say, it is gratefully received.

00:04:54.294 --> 00:04:56.296
I am most humbled by your words.

00:04:57.046 --> 00:04:59.048
I was a bit unsure of my welcome here.

00:04:59.632 --> 00:05:03.469
In truth, I feared you may have been
displeased by my cousin's failings.

00:05:03.553 --> 00:05:06.597
I was so troubled,
I hardly slept last night.

00:05:06.681 --> 00:05:08.266
So I see.

00:05:08.975 --> 00:05:11.352
It could hardly have been
an easy decision,

00:05:11.436 --> 00:05:13.104
as you are his cousin.

00:05:14.022 --> 00:05:16.733
Yet, for a moral lady such as yourself,

00:05:16.816 --> 00:05:18.401
there could be no other course

00:05:18.484 --> 00:05:21.404
than to immediately come
in the deep hours of the night

00:05:21.487 --> 00:05:25.241
and inform me, the Left State Councilor,
and our young In-ho.

00:05:25.325 --> 00:05:27.160
I need hardly mention,

00:05:27.243 --> 00:05:30.121
the chaste daughter-in-law
residing in this house.

00:05:31.164 --> 00:05:33.207
We all thank you, my lady.

00:05:34.083 --> 00:05:35.126
This morning,

00:05:35.835 --> 00:05:40.340
I impressed upon In-ho that while study
is a commendable occupation,

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:43.384
it is best to do it by oneself.

00:05:44.135 --> 00:05:47.138
Hence, he will not be bothering
your cousin anymore.

00:05:47.221 --> 00:05:49.182
Your words bring me comfort.

00:05:49.849 --> 00:05:52.268
Though I confess with some reservations.

00:05:54.687 --> 00:05:57.148
Hmm? Which are?

00:06:02.695 --> 00:06:04.280
While I am fond of the girl,

00:06:04.364 --> 00:06:07.158
and I would like to trust her
to do what is right,

00:06:07.241 --> 00:06:10.286
I must remind you that
when my cousin is involved, well,

00:06:11.245 --> 00:06:13.581
he is no ordinary gentleman.

00:06:14.165 --> 00:06:15.541
I am aware.

00:06:15.625 --> 00:06:17.377
What with his reputation…

00:06:18.878 --> 00:06:23.466
…and the exceptional impression
he makes in person.

00:06:23.549 --> 00:06:26.260
Who could fail to draw such a conclusion?

00:06:28.805 --> 00:06:31.015
If I may make a suggestion.

00:06:32.475 --> 00:06:35.978
In the end, they are but
a young man and lady, are they not?

00:06:37.647 --> 00:06:39.440
Though a lamp casts two shadows,

00:06:39.524 --> 00:06:41.901
in the night,
all boundaries may disappear.

00:06:43.152 --> 00:06:45.154
Perhaps it would be safer

00:06:45.238 --> 00:06:48.116
to keep them apart from each other
for the time being?

00:06:48.199 --> 00:06:50.868
Even if the separation be made by force.

00:06:54.122 --> 00:06:55.123
Hmm.

00:06:56.582 --> 00:06:59.210
I humbly apologize. I was too bold.

00:07:16.686 --> 00:07:17.728
Come now.

00:07:21.691 --> 00:07:23.526
There's no need for all that.

00:07:25.236 --> 00:07:26.904
Huh…

00:07:26.988 --> 00:07:30.032
If you continue like this,
I shall be put out.

00:07:30.616 --> 00:07:31.701
Good heavens.

00:07:31.784 --> 00:07:35.329
If my lord husband were to see this,
I should be in for a scolding.

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:37.999
Now raise those eyes.

00:07:38.082 --> 00:07:39.667
Come now.

00:07:44.797 --> 00:07:46.841
How is your husband, by the way?

00:07:47.675 --> 00:07:49.802
How has his career been faring?

00:07:49.886 --> 00:07:51.345
Quite well.

00:07:51.429 --> 00:07:53.848
Though if the councilor
were to summon him,

00:07:53.931 --> 00:07:55.600
he would be most grateful.

00:07:58.269 --> 00:07:59.270
Hmm.

00:08:14.285 --> 00:08:15.912
My dear! My dear!

00:08:18.706 --> 00:08:19.999
My dear!

00:08:21.709 --> 00:08:23.419
My dear wife.

00:08:25.546 --> 00:08:26.589
Excellent news.

00:08:26.672 --> 00:08:28.508
The Left State Councilor has summoned me.

00:08:29.342 --> 00:08:30.760
I am to visit court.

00:08:31.427 --> 00:08:33.888
Oh, how long it has been.

00:08:35.848 --> 00:08:37.058
Too long.

00:08:37.141 --> 00:08:41.395
But it would appear by this, the councilor
has not forgotten your ability.

00:08:42.563 --> 00:08:44.315
I have you to thank, my lady.

00:08:45.733 --> 00:08:48.236
You have been calling
on the Lady of the First Rank

00:08:48.319 --> 00:08:49.529
nearly every day.

00:08:49.612 --> 00:08:50.988
I am well aware.

00:08:51.072 --> 00:08:53.824
No, surely it was not that.

00:08:53.908 --> 00:08:56.118
My noble wife.

00:09:07.296 --> 00:09:08.422
Dearest lady.

00:09:10.341 --> 00:09:11.342
Listen…

00:09:12.718 --> 00:09:13.719
The truth is,

00:09:15.346 --> 00:09:17.139
I am well aware

00:09:18.182 --> 00:09:20.851
that I am the reason
we have not sired an heir.

00:09:21.727 --> 00:09:23.688
The failure is mine alone.

00:09:24.564 --> 00:09:27.066
I knew it was futile, but nevertheless,

00:09:27.149 --> 00:09:29.235
I took in a concubine.

00:09:31.195 --> 00:09:35.116
It weighs mightily upon my heart
that I cannot fulfill your wishes.

00:09:35.616 --> 00:09:39.662
Especially as you are always
tirelessly striving for my sake.

00:09:43.207 --> 00:09:45.751
My lord, do not speak in this manner.

00:09:47.336 --> 00:09:50.006
So-ok will prove herself
equal to the task.

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:55.428
Of one thing I am certain,
you will sire a strong heir.

00:09:58.389 --> 00:09:59.390
Truly?

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:12.570
Indeed. If my lady says it,
then it must be so.

00:10:13.070 --> 00:10:15.072
I shall prove to the entire household

00:10:15.573 --> 00:10:18.534
that I am yet a man, hale and hearty!

00:10:19.118 --> 00:10:20.286
Put me down, my lord.

00:10:20.369 --> 00:10:22.538
-You'll hurt yourself!
-I am feeling younger already!

00:10:29.003 --> 00:10:31.380
-My lady.
-Pray, put me down.

00:11:05.831 --> 00:11:07.041
Mind your step.

00:11:15.675 --> 00:11:16.759
Forgive me, miss.

00:11:22.181 --> 00:11:23.182
You.

00:11:23.849 --> 00:11:24.850
Yes?

00:11:27.603 --> 00:11:28.604
Uh…

00:11:29.689 --> 00:11:31.190
Where are you headed?

00:11:32.858 --> 00:11:35.444
Uh, I was just out for a walk.

00:11:35.945 --> 00:11:38.406
Uh, I heard the moon was nice.

00:11:40.366 --> 00:11:42.034
Oh.

00:11:44.495 --> 00:11:45.496
Who is it?

00:11:46.288 --> 00:11:50.084
The person you are attempting to meet
under this lovely moon?

00:11:50.167 --> 00:11:52.420
-Oh, no one. I--
-Uh-uh!

00:11:53.087 --> 00:11:55.548
Do not lie.

00:11:56.966 --> 00:11:59.927
It was Young Master In-ho.

00:12:25.453 --> 00:12:28.122
This is a sketch
based on what I saw in a book.

00:12:28.789 --> 00:12:29.874
It's an alarm clock.

00:12:31.208 --> 00:12:34.295
It allows one to know the time
by looking with the eye.

00:12:34.378 --> 00:12:37.715
This position means
a quarter hour past 9:00.

00:12:37.798 --> 00:12:40.050
The single drumbeat earlier
told us it was 7:00,

00:12:40.551 --> 00:12:41.886
which is shown thus.

00:12:41.969 --> 00:12:42.970
And soon,

00:12:44.096 --> 00:12:45.306
they will signal 9:00.

00:12:48.768 --> 00:12:52.062
I shall be listening as well,
but we must take care not to miss it.

00:12:52.563 --> 00:12:55.524
Go stand outside the gate,
and when they beat the drum twice,

00:12:55.608 --> 00:12:57.109
you must come tell me at once.

00:12:57.860 --> 00:12:58.861
Yes, sir.

00:12:59.487 --> 00:13:01.572
-Two beats of the drum.
-Mmm.

00:13:01.655 --> 00:13:02.656
My lord.

00:13:02.740 --> 00:13:04.825
So you planned to meet

00:13:05.993 --> 00:13:08.621
when these hands
were stretched out like the horizon?

00:13:09.205 --> 00:13:10.247
Y-Yes.

00:13:10.331 --> 00:13:12.458
I have no words
to express my astonishment.

00:13:12.541 --> 00:13:15.169
Please! I humbly apologize, my lord.

00:13:15.252 --> 00:13:17.213
I meant nothing by it.

00:13:22.885 --> 00:13:24.345
You do realize

00:13:25.638 --> 00:13:29.934
I'm duty-bound to inform my brother-in-law
and cousin about this matter.

00:13:30.559 --> 00:13:32.353
But I would be most troubled

00:13:32.853 --> 00:13:35.231
if I had to betray the Young Master In-ho.

00:13:36.398 --> 00:13:40.236
It seems to honor my loyalty,
I must go against my duty.

00:13:40.736 --> 00:13:42.863
Oh, how curious.

00:13:43.906 --> 00:13:45.157
Why have you come so early?

00:13:47.284 --> 00:13:48.285
What?

00:13:54.583 --> 00:13:57.378
I know but little about this device here,

00:13:57.461 --> 00:13:59.630
but is there not ample time remaining

00:14:00.130 --> 00:14:02.716
for the hands to stretch out horizontally?

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:03.801
Huh?

00:14:05.135 --> 00:14:08.389
What? I could have sworn it was…

00:14:08.472 --> 00:14:10.766
You carry it
without knowing how to read it?

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:13.727
Oh, no. I know how to read it, of course.

00:14:15.271 --> 00:14:16.647
I'm sure you do.

00:14:18.107 --> 00:14:20.150
I really do know.

00:14:21.151 --> 00:14:23.654
I admit that today

00:14:24.446 --> 00:14:27.867
I'm greatly troubled,
and my mind is unsettled.

00:14:29.201 --> 00:14:30.911
I shall therefore pretend

00:14:32.037 --> 00:14:33.414
I have not seen you here.

00:14:38.168 --> 00:14:39.837
Do you really mean it, my lord?

00:14:39.920 --> 00:14:43.632
You would do well
not to draw attention by wandering.

00:14:43.716 --> 00:14:45.092
Wait till the agreed time.

00:14:45.718 --> 00:14:49.263
You may occupy yourself
by reading Elementary Learning aloud.

00:14:49.346 --> 00:14:52.308
I shall be listening outside
to see if I can hear you.

00:14:54.602 --> 00:14:56.520
Elementary Learning?

00:14:56.604 --> 00:14:58.022
You don't even know that?

00:14:58.105 --> 00:15:00.357
Uh, yes, I-I know it.

00:15:00.441 --> 00:15:01.859
It's just…

00:15:01.942 --> 00:15:03.277
Just what?

00:15:03.861 --> 00:15:04.862
Well…

00:15:04.945 --> 00:15:06.739
I shall alert my cousin.

00:15:06.822 --> 00:15:09.825
I'm going. I'm going. I'm going, my lord.

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:18.959
Young Master In-ho, you say?
What to make of that?

00:15:19.543 --> 00:15:23.380
If I can get him to wait, So-ok could…

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:28.052
What an utter mess.

00:15:42.191 --> 00:15:44.652
Young master, the hour is 9:00.

00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:12.221
Hmm.

00:16:14.348 --> 00:16:18.852
"Once a girl has reached the age of ten,
she ought to refrain from going out.

00:16:18.936 --> 00:16:23.107
She must listen to her teacher and mother
with meekness and follow their teachings.

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:25.901
She should be engaged in tending of hemp"…

00:16:25.985 --> 00:16:27.236
Hmm? Oh.

00:16:31.448 --> 00:16:34.702
…"raising silkworms,
spinning thread, weaving silk,

00:16:34.785 --> 00:16:37.162
and braiding silk sash among other"…

00:16:50.175 --> 00:16:51.635
I was reading it! I read it!

00:16:53.178 --> 00:16:54.179
Huh?

00:16:58.308 --> 00:17:01.729
Oh, no. Oh, no. Young master…

00:17:13.615 --> 00:17:14.616
Huh?

00:17:16.785 --> 00:17:18.537
What?

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:24.501
Huh?

00:17:25.335 --> 00:17:26.795
Surely not.

00:17:26.879 --> 00:17:29.923
He could not have left
simply because I was slightly late.

00:17:47.816 --> 00:17:49.151
Um…

00:17:55.407 --> 00:17:57.493
Why did you not meet me last night?

00:17:57.576 --> 00:17:58.577
What?

00:17:59.244 --> 00:18:00.245
Um…

00:18:00.996 --> 00:18:03.332
I was most certainly there.

00:18:03.415 --> 00:18:04.666
I'm sure you were.

00:18:05.334 --> 00:18:07.127
And you could not wait a moment.

00:18:09.546 --> 00:18:10.589
I understand.

00:18:11.090 --> 00:18:12.382
The fault is all mine.

00:18:12.925 --> 00:18:15.177
I have committed a most grievous offense!

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:18.597
Oh, I didn't mean
to suggest it was your fault.

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:21.350
I know what you thought.

00:18:22.434 --> 00:18:24.728
You thought you could dismiss
a woman such as I.

00:18:25.312 --> 00:18:27.523
Dismiss you? That's preposterous.

00:18:27.606 --> 00:18:29.483
-Absolutely untrue.
-It is not untrue!

00:18:30.067 --> 00:18:32.694
You're dismissing me
because I am a concubine!

00:18:44.164 --> 00:18:45.165
A what?

00:18:45.666 --> 00:18:46.667
Are you…

00:18:47.709 --> 00:18:49.128
Huh? What?

00:19:17.781 --> 00:19:18.782
Hmm?

00:19:29.168 --> 00:19:31.461
-Hello, my lord.
-There you are.

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:55.527
His Majesty had summoned me
on a matter of great importance.

00:19:56.945 --> 00:19:59.072
-Oh?
-On my way back from the palace,

00:19:59.156 --> 00:20:00.699
I bought this for you.

00:20:01.450 --> 00:20:03.285
Oh. They're yakgwa.

00:20:03.869 --> 00:20:06.914
-Mmm.
-Oh, my lord, thank you so much for this.

00:20:06.997 --> 00:20:08.040
Of course.

00:20:11.084 --> 00:20:12.669
Mmm.

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:14.880
-Say, "Ah."
-Ah.

00:20:17.424 --> 00:20:18.550
Mmm.

00:20:18.634 --> 00:20:19.718
Mm-hmm.

00:20:24.765 --> 00:20:26.225
Now, my dear,

00:20:26.975 --> 00:20:29.394
I must leave Bukchon for a while.

00:20:29.478 --> 00:20:30.479
Huh?

00:20:30.979 --> 00:20:32.773
I shall not be absent for long.

00:20:33.273 --> 00:20:38.278
While I'm away, mind the madam's teachings
and learn the conduct of a young lady.

00:20:38.362 --> 00:20:40.322
Mmm.

00:20:40.405 --> 00:20:41.949
As soon as I return,

00:20:42.824 --> 00:20:44.868
I will make you my concubine at once.

00:20:44.952 --> 00:20:46.578
-Understood?
-You mean it?

00:20:46.662 --> 00:20:48.247
Oh, yes.

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:50.707
I'd be ever so grateful, my lord.

00:20:59.758 --> 00:21:01.510
This wretched hat.

00:21:10.477 --> 00:21:12.771
It will soon be
Princess Hyegyeong's 60th birthday.

00:21:12.854 --> 00:21:14.439
Hwaseong will host the banquet.

00:21:15.232 --> 00:21:17.067
His Majesty entrusted it to me.

00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:20.779
I shall show you, my lady,

00:21:20.862 --> 00:21:22.739
how resolutely I will make use…

00:21:23.907 --> 00:21:25.742
…of the opportunity you have provided.

00:21:35.544 --> 00:21:36.586
Dear cousin,

00:21:37.379 --> 00:21:39.423
would you be so good as to stay with us,

00:21:39.506 --> 00:21:42.175
just for the time
while your brother-in-law is away?

00:21:42.259 --> 00:21:44.928
You must have many questions to ask of me.

00:21:47.472 --> 00:21:50.434
Now, the young widow, what did she say?

00:21:51.727 --> 00:21:54.187
I have no way of knowing what she said.

00:21:54.271 --> 00:21:56.732
Since you sent that filthy letter,

00:21:57.274 --> 00:22:00.694
I have not caught so much as
a glimpse of the young lady's skirt.

00:22:01.820 --> 00:22:02.821
Indeed,

00:22:03.905 --> 00:22:07.367
who could fathom the state
of the lady's heart at present?

00:22:08.660 --> 00:22:12.914
I can only hope she's still in possession
of her mind.

00:22:13.498 --> 00:22:14.541
Who knows?

00:22:15.042 --> 00:22:16.418
Perhaps no one.

00:22:16.918 --> 00:22:18.587
Could it be, she read the letter

00:22:19.212 --> 00:22:22.257
and became so overcome with lust,
she lost her mind?

00:22:42.694 --> 00:22:45.697
Goodness, I must resolve
to be virtuous from now on.

00:22:46.448 --> 00:22:48.450
My So-ok has entered Bukchon.

00:22:48.533 --> 00:22:51.119
Her mother should bear herself
as befits her station.

00:22:51.203 --> 00:22:52.913
My, oh, my.

00:22:52.996 --> 00:22:55.207
You are more naive than I thought.

00:22:55.290 --> 00:22:58.752
If you knew how the ladies in Bukchon
entertained themselves,

00:22:58.835 --> 00:23:00.712
you would faint dead away.

00:23:00.796 --> 00:23:03.799
-What do I care?
-Oh, did you hear the news?

00:23:03.882 --> 00:23:06.218
Choi, from the folding screen shop,
was banished.

00:23:06.301 --> 00:23:10.013
The Chief State Councilor warned him
to never set foot in Bukchon again.

00:23:10.097 --> 00:23:12.265
Huh. Whatever could he have done?

00:23:12.349 --> 00:23:14.142
The youngest son of the councilor

00:23:15.435 --> 00:23:18.063
is left-handed, is he not?

00:23:18.146 --> 00:23:20.148
Just like Choi
from the folding screen shop.

00:23:20.232 --> 00:23:23.193
So that's where his seed went?

00:23:23.276 --> 00:23:28.657
My word, what an amusing place
this Bukchon is,

00:23:28.740 --> 00:23:30.951
where such things happen every day.

00:23:34.329 --> 00:23:37.457
Madam, Lord Cho Won is here.

00:23:37.541 --> 00:23:38.792
Fine, let him…

00:23:38.875 --> 00:23:40.168
Uh…

00:23:40.794 --> 00:23:42.921
What? What did you say?

00:23:52.055 --> 00:23:53.306
My lord,

00:23:53.890 --> 00:23:57.811
the sample of tobacco I sent you
must have been pleasing indeed.

00:23:58.603 --> 00:24:01.022
I could not forget its taste,
so I came to see you.

00:24:02.941 --> 00:24:06.194
But I must confess,
the scent of these flowers is so strong…

00:24:08.989 --> 00:24:12.325
…that I cannot remember the scent
of the tobacco I came to purchase.

00:24:12.409 --> 00:24:13.952
Oh.

00:24:15.078 --> 00:24:16.455
You may go now.

00:24:17.164 --> 00:24:19.583
I must attend to my esteemed guest.

00:24:22.210 --> 00:24:23.920
Goodbye, my lady.

00:24:27.883 --> 00:24:29.885
Go on now. All of you.

00:24:53.783 --> 00:24:58.455
I wrote to you so long ago,
yet you did not come to see me.

00:24:59.748 --> 00:25:02.334
I thought I should quite perish
with yearning.

00:25:04.669 --> 00:25:09.674
So that is why you dared to send
so brazen a letter as that.

00:25:17.390 --> 00:25:20.769
Did you not tell me once
that you liked that I was fearless?

00:25:20.852 --> 00:25:25.023
And that it was for that very reason
you held me deep in your embrace.

00:25:25.106 --> 00:25:26.650
Brazen or not,

00:25:27.317 --> 00:25:30.445
it seems this letter
has brought you to me once again.

00:25:35.784 --> 00:25:36.868
You…

00:25:38.370 --> 00:25:42.207
have no idea how meddlesome
those scrawlings have proven to be

00:25:42.958 --> 00:25:47.712
or how much trouble that scrap of paper
may still cause me.

00:25:47.796 --> 00:25:50.715
You never even thought of that, did you?

00:25:55.679 --> 00:25:56.680
Bun-hui.

00:25:59.266 --> 00:26:04.354
I am always worrying
about this wet tongue of yours.

00:26:09.234 --> 00:26:10.860
If used unwisely,

00:26:10.944 --> 00:26:12.821
it could become a noose around your neck.

00:26:12.904 --> 00:26:14.781
And yet,

00:26:15.657 --> 00:26:19.661
you so delight in wagging it,
you do not seem to care.

00:26:24.583 --> 00:26:28.169
You speak as though
my letter were a matter of life and death.

00:26:34.217 --> 00:26:35.343
Bun-hui.

00:26:36.720 --> 00:26:39.014
If you do care about your daughter,

00:26:40.348 --> 00:26:43.143
you would do well
to put your brazenness aside.

00:26:46.438 --> 00:26:50.734
It would be all the easier to peek
at the scholar-officials you admire so.

00:26:51.318 --> 00:26:52.986
And if you do play it right,

00:26:53.737 --> 00:26:56.573
you may even join the ranks
of those wives you envy.

00:27:04.581 --> 00:27:08.168
If you truly wish
to enter Bukchon society…

00:27:11.921 --> 00:27:13.757
you must learn to behave

00:27:14.799 --> 00:27:16.551
as though you have neither heard…

00:27:19.262 --> 00:27:20.889
nor seen what you have.

00:27:38.323 --> 00:27:39.783
Do remember that, Bun-hui.

00:27:58.176 --> 00:28:02.806
My lord, please forgive me.
Please forgive us.

00:28:03.390 --> 00:28:04.933
My mother's brush is clumsy.

00:28:05.016 --> 00:28:07.435
I was the one
to copy the letter from her hand.

00:28:07.519 --> 00:28:10.188
If it displeased you,
I beg your pardon on her behalf.

00:28:10.939 --> 00:28:13.441
I swear, until the day I die,

00:28:13.525 --> 00:28:16.236
no word of this matter
shall pass beyond these walls.

00:28:16.319 --> 00:28:17.487
I swear it to you, my lord.

00:28:19.406 --> 00:28:20.490
Amazing…

00:28:22.659 --> 00:28:27.247
To think a mother
had her own daughter copy such a letter.

00:28:32.544 --> 00:28:34.421
My father is all that binds us.

00:28:34.921 --> 00:28:38.258
To honor that bond,
I had no choice but to obey my mother.

00:28:38.341 --> 00:28:41.886
But if I had it my way, I'd have
nothing to do with that filthy wench.

00:28:50.311 --> 00:28:54.607
Fine porcelain for sale!
Fine porcelain for sale! Fine… Yes, sir?

00:28:58.820 --> 00:29:03.366
Your mother seemed to know
quite a bit about paintings.

00:29:04.200 --> 00:29:05.702
Do you share her eye as well?

00:29:05.785 --> 00:29:06.786
What?

00:29:07.454 --> 00:29:10.623
Oh, I am no judge of what is good or bad.

00:29:10.707 --> 00:29:13.001
I can only judge
if something is expensive.

00:29:13.793 --> 00:29:15.587
Really?

00:29:16.796 --> 00:29:19.841
In that case,
what do you make of this painting?

00:29:20.675 --> 00:29:22.427
Will it fetch a decent price?

00:29:23.011 --> 00:29:24.304
Hmm…

00:29:25.096 --> 00:29:28.224
It looks as though
the flowers are swaying in the breeze,

00:29:28.308 --> 00:29:31.728
and the scent of peonies
is practically wafting off the paper.

00:29:33.104 --> 00:29:36.149
The tiny flower buds here,
behind the leaves,

00:29:36.232 --> 00:29:40.445
are so adorable that I want to reach out
and put them in my hair.

00:29:43.656 --> 00:29:46.826
This is a very important occasion
for His Lordship,

00:29:46.910 --> 00:29:48.953
as he has long been away from court.

00:29:49.454 --> 00:29:50.705
Ah…

00:29:58.046 --> 00:29:59.047
Uh…

00:30:00.799 --> 00:30:01.800
Here.

00:30:02.300 --> 00:30:04.260
If you and I work together

00:30:04.344 --> 00:30:07.680
and have this flower painting completed
upon His Lordship's return,

00:30:07.764 --> 00:30:10.642
it would be a most wonderful way
to show him our support.

00:30:13.061 --> 00:30:16.147
Your handwriting was very lovely,
but firm.

00:30:16.231 --> 00:30:18.191
I was deeply impressed by it.

00:30:18.775 --> 00:30:22.153
Let's complete this with your writing.
Any message will do.

00:30:25.740 --> 00:30:26.825
Mm-hmm.

00:31:01.192 --> 00:31:04.237
THE WHITE PEONY IN FULL BLOOM IS

00:31:06.406 --> 00:31:08.700
Why, this is an entirely different style.

00:31:10.076 --> 00:31:12.203
You've changed it for the painting.

00:31:12.829 --> 00:31:15.582
To think you could
so alter your handwriting

00:31:16.124 --> 00:31:18.877
to better suit
the piece's whimsical nature.

00:31:19.878 --> 00:31:23.339
It would seem we have
a remarkable young lady in the house.

00:31:33.349 --> 00:31:34.851
I have committed a sin!

00:31:35.602 --> 00:31:37.604
Pray, have mercy and spare me, madam.

00:31:37.687 --> 00:31:42.275
In truth, I did not write the copies.

00:31:42.358 --> 00:31:44.110
Young Master In-ho did.

00:31:47.030 --> 00:31:50.825
Young Master In-ho of the Kwon house?
The Left State Councilor's son?

00:31:50.909 --> 00:31:53.119
Forgive me. No, just kill me.

00:31:53.202 --> 00:31:55.580
How dare I, a mere concubine!

00:31:59.459 --> 00:32:02.337
At any rate, now it is all over.

00:32:02.420 --> 00:32:06.758
Oh, the young master
has already learned what I am.

00:32:06.841 --> 00:32:07.884
And now…

00:32:08.635 --> 00:32:11.137
And now…

00:32:14.265 --> 00:32:15.266
Hmm…

00:32:17.018 --> 00:32:18.811
Poor thing.

00:32:19.854 --> 00:32:23.399
Being in one man's arms
when your heart is with another.

00:32:23.900 --> 00:32:26.903
It must have weighed so heavily on you.

00:32:32.116 --> 00:32:33.201
Madam?

00:32:33.284 --> 00:32:37.372
When the young master found out,
did he refuse to acknowledge you at all?

00:32:37.455 --> 00:32:41.209
I told him. And I have not seen him since.

00:32:43.544 --> 00:32:46.756
Oh.

00:32:48.716 --> 00:32:53.513
I fear for your heart,
which is delicate as a flower petal.

00:32:58.393 --> 00:32:59.727
Listen to me.

00:32:59.811 --> 00:33:03.022
As long as you serve
His Lordship dutifully,

00:33:03.856 --> 00:33:06.401
I can turn a blind eye in such matters.

00:33:08.736 --> 00:33:13.992
I am not unaware of how difficult
life can be for a woman in Bukchon.

00:33:15.952 --> 00:33:17.161
Madam.

00:33:18.287 --> 00:33:19.288
Tell me.

00:33:19.872 --> 00:33:22.667
There's no one else
who knows about this, is there?

00:33:22.750 --> 00:33:24.335
Mal-ttong is the only one who…

00:33:29.799 --> 00:33:32.885
Lord Cho Won has a passing knowledge
of the matter.

00:33:37.557 --> 00:33:39.017
Oh, goodness.

00:33:43.938 --> 00:33:45.189
I would go to my cousin.

00:33:46.107 --> 00:33:48.609
-What?
-I would go to him and beg for mercy.

00:33:50.069 --> 00:33:52.155
He knows what spring is for a woman.

00:33:53.573 --> 00:33:56.367
If your plea to him
is sufficiently heartfelt,

00:33:56.909 --> 00:34:00.329
he will surely set his duty aside,
and look the other way.

00:34:00.413 --> 00:34:04.333
T-Truly? Do you think he will?

00:34:05.334 --> 00:34:06.669
If I were to guess,

00:34:07.628 --> 00:34:11.883
he would gladly be a bridge
between you and Master In-ho.

00:34:12.800 --> 00:34:14.469
Oh.

00:34:19.515 --> 00:34:20.683
Mmm.

00:34:36.991 --> 00:34:39.202
Oh. Oh, my lord.

00:34:40.828 --> 00:34:44.415
Um, I have something to say to you.

00:34:44.499 --> 00:34:45.500
Right now?

00:34:46.501 --> 00:34:47.502
Yes.

00:34:51.422 --> 00:34:52.423
Very well.

00:35:03.476 --> 00:35:04.602
A letter?

00:35:06.395 --> 00:35:08.272
This may take a while.

00:35:10.900 --> 00:35:15.404
Do you think it is suitable
to leave your shoes outside in plain view?

00:35:15.905 --> 00:35:16.906
Hmm?

00:35:19.367 --> 00:35:21.202
What I mean is…

00:35:23.329 --> 00:35:27.291
do you think it is wise to allow
someone else to see that you are here?

00:35:39.887 --> 00:35:42.223
Um, my lord.

00:35:52.650 --> 00:35:56.737
The young master has found out
that I am a concubine of this house.

00:35:56.821 --> 00:35:57.947
You kept it secret?

00:35:58.030 --> 00:35:59.866
I did not mean to.

00:36:00.449 --> 00:36:01.450
At any rate,

00:36:02.785 --> 00:36:06.497
what should I write?
How can I make him forgive me?

00:36:07.665 --> 00:36:09.375
My…

00:36:11.335 --> 00:36:13.671
You do rather look like her.

00:36:14.380 --> 00:36:15.423
Like who?

00:36:20.303 --> 00:36:21.846
Luckily for you,

00:36:22.430 --> 00:36:25.892
I am somewhat of a master in this area.

00:36:27.226 --> 00:36:28.311
A master?

00:36:32.857 --> 00:36:34.233
"How could you…

00:36:36.986 --> 00:36:40.156
only brush my shoulders and pass on?

00:36:44.577 --> 00:36:48.331
I think of you, young master,
and find the breath caught in my chest.

00:36:49.832 --> 00:36:51.792
I was wet all through the night,

00:36:53.085 --> 00:36:54.629
and left in quite a state."

00:36:55.213 --> 00:36:56.214
"Breathe"?

00:36:57.340 --> 00:36:58.758
Um, my lord.

00:37:01.552 --> 00:37:04.055
How do you spell the word "breathe" again?

00:37:05.056 --> 00:37:07.516
Is there another "E" at the end, or not?

00:37:15.733 --> 00:37:16.901
That's it.

00:37:21.989 --> 00:37:23.616
You did spell it right.

00:37:33.167 --> 00:37:35.586
"My legs keep spreading apart.

00:37:40.424 --> 00:37:44.303
If only I had a pair of large hands
to take hold of them."

00:37:47.974 --> 00:37:49.100
"I long for you.

00:37:53.062 --> 00:37:55.731
You are in my thoughts tonight,
young master."

00:38:09.537 --> 00:38:11.414
"When I see you next…

00:38:16.460 --> 00:38:18.963
I expect you to scold my womanhood."

00:38:28.055 --> 00:38:29.807
"I beg this of you."

00:39:01.881 --> 00:39:03.090
Yes, there it is.

00:39:05.343 --> 00:39:06.844
And what shall you do next?

00:39:10.306 --> 00:39:13.059
Imagine, if you will,
that I am Young Master In-ho.

00:39:14.393 --> 00:39:18.105
What shall you do to appease my anger?

00:39:53.265 --> 00:39:54.809
Young master.

00:40:05.820 --> 00:40:07.405
It is I, So-ok.

00:40:09.740 --> 00:40:11.075
Young master.

00:40:14.912 --> 00:40:17.665
Young mas… I…

00:40:18.707 --> 00:40:21.127
Please do not leave, young master!

00:40:24.380 --> 00:40:25.840
Oh, why?

00:40:26.632 --> 00:40:28.175
Why, oh, why?

00:40:29.760 --> 00:40:31.720
What cruel aberration is this?

00:40:31.804 --> 00:40:32.972
It is I, So-ok!

00:40:33.889 --> 00:40:35.433
-So-ok.
-A concubine?

00:40:39.478 --> 00:40:41.856
From the day we could not see each other,

00:40:43.149 --> 00:40:44.692
I could not sleep.

00:40:44.775 --> 00:40:46.777
I was thinking of you, young master.

00:40:46.861 --> 00:40:49.738
My lady.

00:40:53.534 --> 00:40:56.662
There is not an ounce of falsehood
in what you have said.

00:40:57.371 --> 00:40:58.497
There couldn't be.

00:41:10.217 --> 00:41:11.260
Oh.

00:41:21.270 --> 00:41:22.771
I feel the same way.

00:41:23.898 --> 00:41:24.940
I, too…

00:41:31.489 --> 00:41:33.574
have been thinking of you, my lady.

00:41:35.743 --> 00:41:38.078
I, too, have spent many sleepless nights

00:41:38.162 --> 00:41:40.664
in heartrending agony.

00:42:28.045 --> 00:42:30.339
On this moonlit night…

00:42:33.133 --> 00:42:35.094
that which we longed for…

00:42:37.680 --> 00:42:39.431
and carefully folded away…

00:42:41.559 --> 00:42:44.603
I wish to unfold here and now together.

00:42:47.940 --> 00:42:49.942
I wish for the same.

00:42:52.653 --> 00:42:54.613
Unfold to your heart's content.

00:42:56.574 --> 00:42:58.075
Allow me to begin.

00:43:14.008 --> 00:43:15.509
Very well then.

00:43:16.635 --> 00:43:19.305
We are growing ever so close, my lady.

00:43:22.057 --> 00:43:23.100
Indeed.

00:43:24.310 --> 00:43:26.520
The Young Master In-ho,
who you longed for,

00:43:27.104 --> 00:43:28.314
is here for you now.

00:43:31.650 --> 00:43:33.444
As is your So-ok.

00:43:45.456 --> 00:43:46.665
My lady.

00:43:51.337 --> 00:43:52.421
Now, then.

00:44:11.148 --> 00:44:12.274
Your hand.

00:44:15.110 --> 00:44:16.111
Right.

00:44:17.112 --> 00:44:20.199
I would like my young master to begin.

00:44:21.116 --> 00:44:22.576
Yes, my lady.

00:44:23.243 --> 00:44:25.788
Young master.

00:44:39.134 --> 00:44:40.219
Oh, my…

00:44:47.142 --> 00:44:49.687
About the flower bud
you sent me last night.

00:44:50.187 --> 00:44:53.565
Before I even laid a hand on her,
she was already half-naked.

00:44:54.066 --> 00:44:56.068
I nearly lost my wits
and allowed the chase

00:44:56.151 --> 00:44:58.654
-to end anticlimactically.
-It is I, So-ok, madam.

00:44:58.737 --> 00:45:00.197
But I am still myself.

00:45:00.948 --> 00:45:03.075
If I were to simply grant you
what you desire,

00:45:03.158 --> 00:45:06.245
I feared our wager would become
a rather hollow affair.

00:45:06.829 --> 00:45:08.914
Somehow I managed to send her away.

00:45:09.415 --> 00:45:11.250
Did you sleep well last night, madam?

00:45:11.333 --> 00:45:12.376
For now,

00:45:12.459 --> 00:45:16.088
I shall focus on my original goal
of conquering the young widow.

00:45:17.047 --> 00:45:18.882
Wait for me, dear cousin.

00:45:19.717 --> 00:45:23.387
I look forward to claiming
that irresistible reward of yours.

00:45:25.597 --> 00:45:26.724
Let me see.

00:45:45.200 --> 00:45:49.204
"It was merely
a harmless jape, therefore"…

00:45:50.956 --> 00:45:53.542
Ah. Oh, master, what took you so long?

00:45:53.625 --> 00:45:55.711
You're supposed to stand
while you wait for me,

00:45:55.794 --> 00:45:57.087
you insolent creature.

00:45:57.755 --> 00:46:00.299
Here. Go and deliver this to the lady.

00:46:00.382 --> 00:46:02.676
The lady has already left,
and took Eun-sil.

00:46:05.304 --> 00:46:07.222
She went to Hwaseong to visit family.

00:46:07.306 --> 00:46:08.932
What's this all about anyhow?

00:46:36.710 --> 00:46:38.045
Late last night,

00:46:39.546 --> 00:46:42.549
the late Lord An appeared to me
in a dream.

00:46:43.717 --> 00:46:45.427
He said he wished to see you.

00:46:46.970 --> 00:46:50.599
He reached out his hand,
and held tight to mine.

00:47:22.172 --> 00:47:26.677
I suppose he must have been missing you.

00:47:31.515 --> 00:47:33.934
Go and visit your parents' house.

00:49:24.378 --> 00:49:26.755
Oh! Eun-sil! Eun-sil!

00:49:27.255 --> 00:49:30.801
Eun-sil! Oh!

00:49:32.302 --> 00:49:33.470
Eun-sil!

00:49:36.598 --> 00:49:38.850
Madam! Madam!

00:49:39.559 --> 00:49:41.561
Madam! Oh, madam!

00:49:42.854 --> 00:49:44.231
Lord Cho Won is here.

00:49:45.273 --> 00:49:46.441
Did you hear what I said?

00:49:46.942 --> 00:49:49.361
The lord, Cho Won,
has come all the way here.

00:49:54.408 --> 00:49:55.534
Madam.

00:50:17.764 --> 00:50:20.267
You're here. I'll just--

00:50:20.934 --> 00:50:22.644
What is this? Come now!

00:50:22.728 --> 00:50:24.604
What is the meaning of this?

00:50:24.688 --> 00:50:26.606
Oh, my lady.

00:50:30.360 --> 00:50:33.030
Well, Eun-sil, tell me,

00:50:33.113 --> 00:50:35.073
have you informed the lady I am here?

00:50:35.824 --> 00:50:37.868
-Yes.
-Oh, good.

00:50:37.951 --> 00:50:40.120
And what did she say?

00:50:40.203 --> 00:50:42.289
That you have no reason to be here,

00:50:43.081 --> 00:50:44.916
and you should go back at once.

00:50:45.500 --> 00:50:46.585
Oh. Uh…

00:50:47.794 --> 00:50:48.795
That's…

00:50:49.629 --> 00:50:51.673
That cannot be.

00:50:53.050 --> 00:50:55.177
That simply cannot be true.

00:50:57.054 --> 00:50:59.556
-Go get her.
-Tell your lady again.

00:51:01.558 --> 00:51:03.310
Tell her I will not take a single step…

00:51:04.144 --> 00:51:05.437
Look.

00:51:06.021 --> 00:51:08.148
…until she agrees to come out and face me.

00:51:08.231 --> 00:51:10.275
She did as she pleased,
leaving without a word,

00:51:10.358 --> 00:51:11.943
so I will do as I please as well.

00:51:12.944 --> 00:51:14.029
I will wait for her.

00:51:14.738 --> 00:51:16.948
See that you relay
exactly what I have said.

00:51:17.032 --> 00:51:18.867
My lord, please do not do this to her.

00:51:19.367 --> 00:51:20.827
Please go back at once.

00:51:20.911 --> 00:51:22.621
What if the master of this house
should see you?

00:51:23.205 --> 00:51:24.206
I'm sorry.

00:51:27.751 --> 00:51:29.836
Come now! Tell her as I said!

00:52:12.546 --> 00:52:16.675
Madam, if you're going to be like this,
you may as well see him.

00:52:20.262 --> 00:52:22.597
He is still here. He hasn't left.

00:52:24.391 --> 00:52:26.393
I hope he hasn't frozen in the rain.

00:52:40.907 --> 00:52:43.285
Get away! Go, go!

00:52:43.368 --> 00:52:45.412
Hurry up and go! Go!

00:52:54.588 --> 00:52:56.339
Cho Won, that rascal.

00:52:56.840 --> 00:53:00.844
What was he intending by making you
write a letter of explanation for him?

00:53:01.678 --> 00:53:02.846
Out with it.

00:53:02.929 --> 00:53:05.682
Mother, I swear,
I don't know anything, really.

00:53:06.850 --> 00:53:09.644
All I know is Lord Cho Won
sought me out this morning.

00:53:09.728 --> 00:53:11.605
He said if I did not write what he wanted,

00:53:11.688 --> 00:53:14.149
he would ensure
disgrace came to our family.

00:53:14.733 --> 00:53:19.070
I was worried that some misfortune
might befall you if I refused,

00:53:20.280 --> 00:53:22.324
so I did as he told me to do.

00:53:23.825 --> 00:53:25.243
Think about it, Mother.

00:53:25.785 --> 00:53:28.538
Why would a man like him explain himself?

00:53:29.456 --> 00:53:30.498
Really.

00:53:30.582 --> 00:53:32.626
You said it yourself, Mother. I'm…

00:53:33.293 --> 00:53:35.378
I'm an unbecoming and ill-bred girl.

00:53:35.462 --> 00:53:37.923
For heaven's sake.

00:53:38.006 --> 00:53:40.091
Why would he explain himself to me?

00:53:41.509 --> 00:53:44.012
I just did as I was told, Mother.

00:53:44.095 --> 00:53:45.722
Please believe me.

00:53:48.642 --> 00:53:50.518
So-ok may know what's going on.

00:53:52.062 --> 00:53:53.521
Why would So-ok know?

00:53:54.356 --> 00:53:56.775
Because that is Cho Won's cousin's house.

00:53:56.858 --> 00:53:59.736
Go over there to eavesdrop
and find out what you can.

00:53:59.819 --> 00:54:04.157
Go find out the reason why Cho Won
made you do such a ridiculous thing!

00:54:06.326 --> 00:54:08.453
Could you, for one fleeting moment,

00:54:09.829 --> 00:54:12.707
show me a glimpse of your face, my lady?

00:54:15.418 --> 00:54:17.254
I shall continue to wait here!

00:54:39.067 --> 00:54:41.194
I wish only to show you my heart…

00:54:44.155 --> 00:54:46.783
…but you will not see it.

00:55:04.843 --> 00:55:07.095
Hey, Chil-seong. This is it.

00:55:13.560 --> 00:55:14.561
Eun-sil.

00:55:16.563 --> 00:55:17.647
W-Where is she?

00:55:34.622 --> 00:55:36.291
The night is most cold.

00:55:38.626 --> 00:55:40.670
You should go back to your home, my lord.

00:55:47.093 --> 00:55:48.720
Are you all right, my lady?

00:55:53.350 --> 00:55:56.728
I wanted you to have this letter.

00:56:02.692 --> 00:56:05.904
That is all. Please read it.

00:56:07.739 --> 00:56:09.407
You will find in this letter…

00:56:11.826 --> 00:56:13.870
my truest feelings.

00:56:15.288 --> 00:56:17.832
It is proof
that my feelings are not false.

00:56:19.626 --> 00:56:20.627
But I…

00:56:21.294 --> 00:56:23.338
I cannot leave like this.

00:56:24.756 --> 00:56:27.175
I must clear
the misunderstanding between us.

00:56:30.136 --> 00:56:32.222
Oh, please.

00:56:33.473 --> 00:56:35.392
Will you not take this letter?

00:56:47.153 --> 00:56:49.280
I had thought our two hearts were one.

00:56:51.825 --> 00:56:53.201
I had thought my heart…

00:56:54.994 --> 00:56:57.747
desired the same thing as yours.
Indeed, I did.

00:56:58.248 --> 00:56:59.374
And yet…

00:56:59.457 --> 00:57:01.960
Oh, if you will not let me
tell this to you,

00:57:02.043 --> 00:57:03.711
what on earth am I to do?

00:57:08.174 --> 00:57:09.175
Why?

00:57:12.387 --> 00:57:14.389
Why did you appear before me?

00:57:16.266 --> 00:57:18.977
Why did you appear
to a lowly creature such as I?

00:57:19.060 --> 00:57:20.353
Was it to kill me?

00:57:22.772 --> 00:57:23.982
Why have you…

00:57:26.568 --> 00:57:28.486
made me long for you?

00:58:00.602 --> 00:58:01.769
Because…

00:58:06.941 --> 00:58:09.235
I want to live, my lord.

00:58:32.967 --> 00:58:34.093
My lady.

00:58:37.805 --> 00:58:39.390
I swear to you…

00:58:43.186 --> 00:58:44.771
I will keep you alive…

00:58:48.525 --> 00:58:49.901
no matter the cost…

00:58:53.029 --> 00:58:54.656
if it's the last thing I do.